---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bail & Anticipatory Bail in Chennai" description="Urgent bail and anticipatory bail applications before Magistrate, Sessions and Madras High Court.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Practice Area</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Bail & Anticipatory Bail</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>When an arrest is imminent or has already occurred, timing is critical. We prepare and file regular bail, anticipatory bail, and interim bail applications on short notice before the appropriate court.</p>
      <p>Our advocates regularly appear before Metropolitan Magistrates, Sessions Courts, and the Madras High Court. We focus on grounds of parity, delay in investigation, medical conditions, and procedural lapses that support release.</p>
      <p>For arrests outside office hours, contact us immediately. Early legal intervention often prevents prolonged custody.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-navy/90 transition">Request Urgent Assistance</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
